
%!includeconf: conf.t2t

= Sparkwyrd =

A Tcl/Tk reimplementation of the Inspiration Pad Pro random text generator,
compatible with ``.ipt`` files (weighted tables, dice expressions,
variables, filters). Useful for encounter generators, NPC creators,
treasure tables, or story seeds for tabletop RPGs.

[images/sparkwyrd.png]

https://github.com/luginf/Sparkwyrd

= Escapades =

A small text-mode roguelike in Lua, made for coffee breaks and endlessly
replayable: a generated surface world (plains, forests, a village), caves and
a multi-level tower, all procedural. Field of view, combat using the ESCAPADES
tabletop RPG system, scriptable quests, bilingual French and English. CP437
rendering, playable in a terminal as well as on the Linux console. The
introductory adventure is The Whispering Tower.

[images/escapades.png]

[github.com/luginf/escapades-roguelike https://github.com/luginf/escapades-roguelike]

= Yi Jing =

A small Tcl/Tk desktop app to identify an I Ching hexagram by toggling its
six yin/yang lines with a click.

[github.com/luginf/hexagrams https://github.com/luginf/hexagrams]
